    "_postman_id": "0f90d466-f9da-4776-9324-d1d0622fd4e7",
    "name": "📌 InclusionAI API (Ant Ling)",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"inclusionAI (IAI) envisions AGI as humanity's shared milestone, not a privileged asset.\"\n\nInclusionAI is Ant Group's AI lab. It builds its own open-weight Ling (general) and Ring (reasoning) models and serves them through the OpenAI-compatible Ant Ling API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Ant Ling Account: [https://www.ant-ling.com/](https://www.ant-ling.com/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `inclusionai_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:inclusionai_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://developer.ant-ling.com/en/docs/getting-started/quickstart/](https://developer.ant-ling.com/en/docs/getting-started/quickstart/)\n    \n- Models: [https://developer.ant-ling.com/en/docs/models/](https://developer.ant-ling.com/en/docs/models/)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
